<title>PERU: Peru money base contracts fall 4.1 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Peru money base contracts fall 4.1 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base fell 4.1 percent during October to stand at 3.403 billion soles at the end of the month, the Central Reserve Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>The money base ended last year at 3.658 billion soles, up from 2.672 billion soles at the start of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
